# Alembic Migrations

This directory contains database migration files for the Active Chess project.

## Running Migrations

### Generate a new migration
```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

### Apply migrations
```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

### Rollback migrations
```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```

### View migration history
```bash
alembic history
```

### View current version
```bash
alembic current
```
